            <h2>Southeast Asia</h2>
            <p>This is the classic backpacker route and one of the cheapest party trips you can do. You start with rooftop bars in Bangkok, then go to a Full Moon Party on a Thai island. Then you see temples during the day and go out on Pub Street at night in Cambodia, and finish with cheap fresh beer on the street corners of Hanoi. The dry season keeps the beaches sunny.</p>

